         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">DS3600-SR Ultra-Rugged Scanner Spec Sheet | Zebra</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The productivity of your warehouse and manufacturing workers depends on the quality of their scanners. The DS3600-SR Ultra-Rugged scanner enables reliable capture of 1D and 2D barcodes at standard rangesâ€”from near contact to nearly 5 ft./1.5 m away.&#xA;Built for your toughest environments, the DS3600-SR is virtually indestructible, including an enhanced 10 ft./3 m drop spec to concrete and dual IP65/IP68 sealing. With DataCapture DNA, Zebraâ€™s exclusive software ecosystem, you can take scanner performance far beyond the basicsâ€”simplifying every stage of the scanning experience over the life of your device. And when it comes to cordless technology, the DS3678-SRâ€™s Zebra-only features put it in a class of its own. The DS3600-SRâ€”the unstoppable performance you need to maximize workforce productivity and throughput in your operations.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
